      {
        "id": "p51-q51-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $20^\\circ$ is a solution of the equation.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\cos40^\\circ\\cos20^\\circ-2\\sin40^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ=2\\cos60^\\circ=1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\cos40^\\circ\\cos20^\\circ-2\\sin40^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ&=2\\cos(40^\\circ+20^\\circ)\\\\2\\cos40^\\circ\\cos20^\\circ-2\\sin40^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ&=2\\cos60^\\circ\\\\2\\cos40^\\circ\\cos20^\\circ-2\\sin40^\\circ\\sin20^\\circ&=1\\end{align*}$$\nThus $\\theta=20^\\circ$ satisfies the equation.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q51-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Show that any solution $\\alpha$ of the equation satisfies\n$$8x^3-6x-1=0,$$\nwhere $x=\\cos\\alpha$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$8x^3-6x-1=0$, where $x=\\cos\\alpha$.\n\nUse the cosine sum identity, expand the double-angle terms and substitute $x=\\cos\\alpha$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\cos3\\alpha&=\\cos2\\alpha\\cos\\alpha-\\sin2\\alpha\\sin\\alpha\\\\\\cos3\\alpha&=(2\\cos^2\\alpha-1)\\cos\\alpha-2\\sin^2\\alpha\\cos\\alpha\\\\\\cos3\\alpha&=2\\cos^3\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha-2(1-\\cos^2\\alpha)\\cos\\alpha\\\\\\cos3\\alpha&=4\\cos^3\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha\\end{align*}$$\nThe given equation therefore gives\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\cos3\\alpha&=1\\\\8\\cos^3\\alpha-6\\cos\\alpha&=1\\\\8\\cos^3\\alpha-6\\cos\\alpha-1&=0\\end{align*}$$\nSubstituting $x=\\cos\\alpha$ gives $8x^3-6x-1=0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q51-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p51-q51-c-theorem-text",
